<import src="../../components/states.wxml"/>
<view class="page"><template is="feedback" data="{{loading,error}}"/><block wx:if="{{!loading && !error}}">
<view class="eyebrow">SMALL STEPS, TOGETHER</view><view class="heading">一起，让改变发生。</view><view class="subtitle">选一个小目标，把坚持变成给自己的礼物。</view><view class="hero dark section"><view class="row top"><view class="grow"><text class="pill dark">轻动城市挑战</text><view class="hero-title">先看奖励，<view>再一起完成目标。</view></view><view class="hero-desc">累计签到，每一天的努力都算数。</view></view><view class="challenge-decoration"><image src="/images/ui/flag.svg"/></view></view><view class="hero-bottom row"><text class="small-text">会员体验卡 · 达标后限时领取</text><text class="pill dark">{{activities.length}} 个挑战</text></view></view>
<view class="service-links section"><button class="btn soft" data-url="/pages/events/index" bindtap="go">线下活动广场</button><button class="btn soft" data-url="/pages/reward-tasks/index" bindtap="go">全部多档奖励</button><button class="btn soft" data-url="/pages/team/index" bindtap="go">寻找小队</button><button class="btn soft" data-url="/pages/rank/index" bindtap="go">签到 · 体重 · 小队榜</button></view><view class="segmented section"><button class="segment {{filter === 'all' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-filter="all" bindtap="filterChange">全部挑战</button><button class="segment {{filter === 'mine' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-filter="mine" bindtap="filterChange">我参与的</button><button class="segment {{filter === 'reward' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-filter="reward" bindtap="filterChange">待领奖励</button></view><view wx:if="{{!shown.length}}" class="card section"><view class="empty"><text class="empty-title">给自己选一个小目标</text>还没有相关挑战，先从一天的坚持开始。</view><button class="btn soft" data-filter="all" bindtap="filterChange">看看全部挑战</button></view>
<view wx:for="{{shown}}" wx:key="id" class="card challenge-card list-gap" data-url="/pages/activity/index?id={{item.id}}" bindtap="go"><view class="row"><text class="pill">{{item.tag}}</text><text class="small-text">{{item.remainingSlots}} 份奖励名额剩余</text></view><view class="row mt"><view class="activity-art {{item.color}}"><image class="icon" src="/images/ui/{{item.icon}}.svg"/></view><view class="grow"><view class="title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="small-text mt-sm">{{item.subtitle}}</view></view></view><view class="divider"></view><view wx:if="{{item.enrolled}}"><view class="row mb"><text class="small-text">已坚持 {{item.progress}} / {{item.days}} 天</text><text class="pill">{{item.statusLabel}}</text></view><view class="progress"><view class="progress-fill" style="width:{{item.progressPercent}}%"></view></view></view><view wx:else class="row"><text class="small-text">累计签到 {{item.days}} 天</text><text class="link">{{item.statusLabel}} ↗</text></view><view class="reward-line"><image class="inline-icon" src="/images/ui/gift.svg"/><text>完成赠 {{item.rewardDays}} 天会员 · 每日 3 次模拟识餐</text><text class="arrow">›</text></view></view><view class="notice section">当前挑战、名额和奖励均为本机模拟数据，用于体验完整流程，不产生真实会员权益。</view><button class="btn ghost mt" data-url="/pages/rank/index" bindtap="go">看看轻动伙伴的坚持榜 ↗</button>
</block><view class="footnote">轻动 · 每一步坚持，都值得被看见</view></view>
